+/* Compatibility mode for applications which recycle host uniform data while
+ * recording a command buffer. Capture the descriptor's bytes at its recorded use
+ * and retain the upload allocation until the command buffer is reset. This is
+ * deliberately opt-in: Vulkan applications may legally update uniform contents
